//NewBerg quests
{1000}{You have been tasked with hunting the Man in Black, also called Walter. If you can find this man, you are to find out anything he knows about the Baron's death in Gilead, and take him into custody if possible.}
{1001}{Erenor Fenwick would like you to convince his daughter, Jana, to return home.}
{1002}{Jana Fenwick needs her father, Erenor, to understand her desire for independence.}
{1003}{Search for a mechanical tophat for Tyrell, at Rath's home, by the Dark River.}
{1004}{Tyrell wants you to find the location of the Dark River.} 
{1005}{Seamus O'Morrow wants you to kill Old Man Gromoth, in Tull.}
{1006}{Farmer Brighton wants me to find out what's killing his cows.}
{1007}{Retrieve Doan's book- Treatise on the History of Gilead. He seems to believe Daniel Derry has it.}
{1008}{Geofram Gilliam wants you to bring him back a titanium gear from Guybrush's Mechanics in S'Addle.}
{1009}{Tina Cooley needs a statuette retrieved from her hidden stash.}
{1010}{Bara Thorpe wants to find out what happened to the Landers during the Man in Black's visit.}
{1011}{Argnor wants you to obtain some oil from the Black Khans Clan.}
{1012}{Jens needs someone to pick up some Mandrake Root for him from D'nard in the Boroheim Wood.}


